Namazu
======

This software, when built with model artifacts fetched at compile time
(see model-manifest.json), bundles third-party ONNX model files in its
release artifacts. The model files themselves are not committed to this
repository, but their upstream licenses still apply to any redistributed
binary or Docker image that contains them.

