labels-map.json
------------------------------------------------------------------------
A curated mapping from ImageNet-1000 class names to display labels.
The canonical copy lives in the Tanuki repository
(https://github.com/nlfiedler/tanuki) and is treated as part of the
project's own source for licensing purposes.
